      "message": "I don\u0027t see any point in pushing whole environment to the RuleProcessor. It\u0027s relatively easy to fetch only parameters that we need.\nPlus, there might be a situation where somebody will be able to *somehow* access all environment variables by adding some malicious rules.\nHence, I vote for sending over only the subset of variables that will be used.",
